  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support regional governments with Technical Assistance to improve competitivenessi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support governments across the region with TA to improve competitiveness through:
-  the identification and implementation of reforms aimed at improving the &#x201c;investment and doing business&#x201d; climate; and 
- the provision of direct financial and non-financial support to firms and clusters of firms in high growth potential sectors to improve productivity and expand exports.</narrative>
  </description>
